56903,334.82791],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"4","bbox":[481.66641,323.0029,487.78241,338.11691],"origin":[481.66641,334.82791],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Hindering Reactions","bbox":[219.77484,338.59344,318.80783,353.70746],"origin":[219.77484,350.41846],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"6","bbox":[396.62704,338.59344,402.74304,353.70746],"origin":[396.62704,350.41846],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1.5","bbox":[477.07941,338.59344,492.36942,353.70746],"origin":[477.07941,350.41846],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Interpretive Text","bbox":[74.03149,366.64694,182.95149,385.92496],"origin":[74.03149,381.62695],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"None available","bbox":[187.41733,388.19974,260.17133,403.31375],"origin":[187.41733,400.02475],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[74.03149,416.25323,329.95145,435.53125],"origin":[74.03149,431.23325],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The SRS-3-B can be meaningfully used both at the item level","bbox":[187.41733,436.34576,485.16534,451.45978],"origin":[187.41733,448.17078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"(yielding clients’ scores for specific reactions) and at the subscale","bbox":[187.41733,448.44577,505.92236,463.55978],"origin":[187.41733,460.27078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"level (yielding clients’ global evaluation of the session) with a higher","bbox":[187.41733,460.54575,516.32831,475.65976],"origin":[187.41733,472.37076],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"score being indicative of more alignment with the question or","bbox":[187.41733,472.64575,482.71231,487.75977],"origin":[187.41733,484.47076],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"subscale - therefore,  a positive experience are typically indicated by","bbox":[187.41733,484.74576,520.00232,499.85977],"origin":[187.41733,496.57077],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"higher Helpful Reactions score and a lower Hindering Reactions","bbox":[187.41733,496.84576,499.20123,511.95978],"origin":[187.41733,508.67078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"score.","bbox":[187.41733,508.94574,217.37032,524.05975],"origin":[187.41733,520.77075],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"It is important to note that higher scores on the Hinder Reactions","bbox":[187.41733,533.14575,501.67636,548.25977],"origin":[187.41733,544.97076],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"subscale or lower scores on the Helpful Reactions subscale should","bbox":[187.41733,545.24579,513.27026,560.3598],"origin":[187.41733,557.0708],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"be interpreted in light of a therapists knowledge of the therapeutic","bbox":[187.41733,557.34576,505.97736,572.45978],"origin":[187.41733,569.17078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"relationship. For example, this pattern of responding could be","bbox":[187.41733,569.44574,485.78134,584.55975],"origin":[187.41733,581.27075],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"indicative of your client's honesty with you due to their experience of","bbox":[187.41733,581.54578,518.45135,596.65979],"origin":[187.41733,593.37079],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"unconditional positive regard. It is the process of using the SRS-3-B","bbox":[187.41733,593.64575,516.95538,608.75977],"origin":[187.41733,605.47076],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"that is of greatest clinical use as opposed to just a simple","bbox":[187.41733,605.74579,464.9913,620.8598],"origin":[187.41733,617.5708],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"interpretation of the score. ","bbox":[187.41733,617.84576,318.26236,632.95978],"origin":[187.41733,629.67078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Raw scores and an average score (between 1 and 5) are presented.","bbox":[187.41733,642.04572,520.02435,657.15973],"origin":[187.41733,653.87073],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"An average score for each subscale is presented so that the two","bbox":[187.41733,654.14575,500.4664,669.25977],"origin":[187.41733,665.97076],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"can be compared (as there are a different number of items in each","bbox":[187.41733,666.24579,510.23438,681.3598],"origin":[187.41733,678.0708],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"scale). The two subscales measured are:","bbox":[187.41733,678.34576,387.93631,693.45978],"origin":[187.41733,690.17078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1. Helpful Reactions (Items 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 9, 11, 13, 14) -","bbox":[187.41733,702.54578,467.45557,717.65979],"origin":[187.41733,714.37079],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"measuring reactions such as the client gaining a new perspective,","bbox":[187.41733,714.64575,507.78131,729.75977],"origin":[187.41733,726.47076],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"feeling more empowered, hopeful or positive, and having clear goals","bbox":[187.41733,726.74573,520.01331,741.85974],"origin":[187.41733,738.57074],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"to work on. ","bbox":[187.41733,738.84576,244.27631,753.95978],"origin":[187.41733,750.67078],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2. Hindering Reactions (Items 5, 8, 10, 12) - measuring reactions","bbox":[187.41733,750.94574,502.87537,766.05975],"origin":[187.41733,762.77075],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 1 of 3","bbox":[467.71652,784.13007,523.98157,799.24408],"origin":[467.71652,795.95508],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[{"bbox":[219.77484,298.8009,521.10144,352.81647],"rows":[["","Raw Score","Average Score\n(1 5)\n-"],["Helpful Reactions","40","4"],["Hindering Reactions","6","1 5\n."]],"cells":[[219.77484,298.8009,357.16531,323.14963],[357.16531,298.8009,442.20465,323.14963],[442.20465,298.8009,521.10144,323.14963],[219.77484,323.14963,357.16531,338.7402],[357.16531,323.14963,442.20465,338.7402],[442.20465,323.14963,521.10144,338.7402],[219.77484,338.7402,357.16531,352.81647],[357.16531,338.7402,442.20465,352.81647],[442.20465,338.7402,521.10144,352.81647]],"header":{"names":["","Raw Score","Average Score\n(1 5)\n-"],"external":false,"bbox":[219.77484,298.8009,521.10144,323.14963]},"status":"geometry_extracted_column_semantics_require_review"}],"chartObservations":[]},{"pageId":"d0c55efd094f6_p2","documentSha256":"0c55efd094f6818a36791303ae32dbdde339155420dc6563a52b915d2901b378","pageNumber":2,"text":[{"text":"                          NovoPsych","bbox":[199.358,56.4795,395.91794,78.4635],"origin":[199.358,73.6795],"font":"Helvetica","size":16.0,"colour":"#007ba3","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[106.06932,112.74515,175.41731,129.26915],"origin":[106.06932,125.58514],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[187.41733,113.23909,257.10233,128.35309],"origin":[187.41733,125.06409],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information (cont.)","bbox":[74.03149,139.87529,376.61337,159.15329],"origin":[74.03149,154.85529],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"such as the client feeling stuck, feeling uncomfortable about what","bbox":[187.41733,159.96785,504.74536,175.08185],"origin":[187.41733,171.79285],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"the therapist is suggesting, and feeling there is a lack of direction or","bbox":[187.41733,172.06783,515.74542,187.18182],"origin":[187.41733,183.89282],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"guidance from the therapist.","bbox":[187.41733,184.1678,323.76236,199.2818],"origin":[187.41733,195.9928],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"For clinical utility, if there is significant variation/inconsistency within","bbox":[187.41733,208.36781,515.67932,223.48181],"origin":[187.41733,220.19281],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"a subscale's scores (defined as a standard deviation greater than or","bbox":[187.41733,220.46779,517.84637,235.58179],"origin":[187.41733,232.29279],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"equal to 0.85), then a note is made in Interpretive Text that it might","bbox":[187.41733,232.56783,511.47745,247.68182],"origin":[187.41733,244.39282],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"be better to be looking at the results of the SRS-3-B at an item level","bbox":[187.41733,244.6678,516.36145,259.7818],"origin":[187.41733,256.4928],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"to gain better insight into the client's view of the session.","bbox":[187.41733,256.76782,460.98737,271.88184],"origin":[187.41733,268.59283],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"A plot is presented after multiple administrations of the SRS-3-B so","bbox":[187.41733,280.96777,513.27039,296.08179],"origin":[187.41733,292.79279],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"that you can track helpful and hindering reactions over time. When","bbox":[187.41733,293.06781,510.23428,308.18182],"origin":[187.41733,304.89282],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"administered repeatedly, variations in patterns of responding are key","bbox":[187.41733,305.16779,521.23431,320.2818],"origin":[187.41733,316.9928],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"to interpreting the results rather than absolute scores. ","bbox":[187.41733,317.26782,450.93338,332.38184],"origin":[187.41733,329.09283],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses","bbox":[74.03149,343.86102,191.50549,363.13904],"origin":[74.03149,358.84103],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Not at all","bbox":[242.59958,373.59677,276.14059,385.27579],"origin":[242.59958,382.73428],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Slightly","bbox":[305.19989,373.59677,332.5954,385.27579],"origin":[305.19989,382.73428],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Somewhat","bbox":[358.34821,373.59677,398.50226,385.27579],"origin":[358.34821,382.73428],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Quite a bit","bbox":[418.58127,373.59677,457.32434,385.27579],